+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to hash passwords with Argon2id, chosen because it is memory-hard and much harder to crack, including with GPU- or ASIC-accelerated attacks. No cost parameters (memory, iterations, parallelism) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
